---
// Histología IA: Segmentación Micro/Macro & Validación de Estudiantes con Gemini 3.5
---

<html lang="es">
	<head>
		<meta charset="utf-8" />
		<link rel="icon" type="image/svg+xml" href="/favicon.svg" />
		<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0" />
		<meta name="generator" content={Astro.generator} />
		<title>Histología IA — Segmentación Micro/Macro & Validación Estudiante</title>
		<meta name="description" content="Segmentación histológica a escala micro y macro con Cellpose y Meta SAM 3.1, y validación interactiva de diagnósticos para estudiantes con Gemini 3.5 Flash." />
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
		<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
		<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=Inter:wght@300;400;500;600;700&family=Outfit:wght@400;500;600;700;800&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">
	</head>
	<body>
		<div class="app-container">
			<header class="app-header">
				<div class="logo-area">
					<div class="glowing-orb"></div>
					<h1>Histología <span class="gradient-text">Studio</span></h1>
					<span class="badge" style="background: rgba(56,189,248,0.15); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(56,189,248,0.3);">Micro & Macro + Gemini 3.5</span>
					<div class="model-status-pills" id="model-status-pills">
						<span class="model-pill active" id="sam3-pill" title="Meta AI Segment Anything Model 3.1">
							<span class="dot green"></span> SAM 3.1
						</span>
						<span class="model-pill active" id="cellpose-pill" title="Cellpose 3 / Cellpose-SAM Histology & Cellular Model">
							<span class="dot green" id="cellpose-dot"></span> Cellpose-SAM (Histología)
						</span>
						<span class="model-pill" id="conch-pill" title="MahmoodLab CONCH Vision-Language (512d)">
							<span class="dot" id="conch-dot"></span> CONCH (512d)
						</span>
						<span class="model-pill" id="uni-pill" title="MahmoodLab UNI ViT-Large (1024d)">
							<span class="dot" id="uni-dot"></span> UNI (1024d)
						</span>
						<span class="model-pill" id="virchow-pill" title="Paige AI Virchow2 ViT-Huge (1280d)">
							<span class="dot" id="virchow-dot"></span> Virchow2 (1280d)
						</span>
						<span class="model-pill active" id="gemini-keys-pill" style="border-color: rgba(14,165,233,0.4); background: rgba(14,165,233,0.08); cursor: pointer;" title="Google Gemini 3.5 Flash | Rotación de API Keys (GOOGLE_API_KEYS) ante 429/403">
							<span class="dot green" id="gemini-keys-dot"></span> 🔑 <strong id="gemini-keys-badge" style="color: #38bdf8;">Gemini 3.5 (Rotación Auto)</strong>
						</span>
						<span class="model-pill active" id="ont-pill" style="border-color: rgba(6,182,212,0.4); background: rgba(6,182,212,0.1); cursor: pointer;" title="Ontología activa. Click para ver ontología e imágenes del PDF.">
							<span class="dot green"></span> 🧬 <strong id="ont-pill-name" style="color: var(--accent-cyan); font-weight: 700;">Cargando...</strong>
						</span>
					</div>
				</div>
				<p class="subtitle">Segmentación histológica a escala micro y macro con Cellpose y Meta SAM 3.1 + Reconocimiento y validación diagnóstica con Gemini 3.5 Flash.</p>
			</header>

			<main class="app-main">
				<!-- LEFT COLUMN: Image Gallery + Controls -->
				<aside class="sidebar-panel">
					<!-- Tab Buttons -->
					<div class="tab-bar">
						<button class="tab-btn active" data-tab="images-tab">🖼️ Imágenes & Escala</button>
						<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="student-quiz-tab" id="tab-btn-student-quiz" style="color: #38bdf8;">🎓 Validación Gemini 3.5 / 3.8</button>
						<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="pdf-tab">📄 PDFs & Ontología</button>
						<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="classes-tab">🏷️ Clases</button>
						<button class="tab-btn" data-tab="export-tab">📊 Reporte</button>
					</div>

					<!-- ==================== IMAGES TAB ==================== -->
					<div class="tab-content active" id="images-tab">
						<label for="file-input" class="upload-zone" id="drop-zone" style="cursor: pointer;">
							<input type="file" id="file-input" accept="image/*,.pdf,application/pdf" multiple class="file-hidden" />
							<div class="upload-content" id="upload-content">
								<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="upload-icon" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
									<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M4 16l4.586-4.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L16 16m-2-2l1.586-1.586a2 2 0 012.828 0L20 14m-6-6h.01M6 20h12a2 2 0 002-2V6a2 2 0 00-2-2H6a2 2 0 00-2 2v12a2 2 0 002 2z" />
								</svg>
								<p class="upload-text">Arrastra imágenes o un <span class="text-link">PDF</span></p>
								<p class="upload-hint">PNG, JPG, JPEG, TIFF o PDF científico</p>
							</div>
						</label>

						<!-- PDF Extracted Images Import Bar -->
						<div id="pdf-images-import-bar" style="margin-top: 0.6rem; padding: 0.6rem 0.75rem; background: rgba(6,182,212,0.05); border: 1px dashed rgba(6,182,212,0.3); border-radius: 8px;">
							<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
								<span style="font-size: 0.75rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-cyan); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;">
									📄 Cargar de PDF / Ontología
								</span>
								<span id="pdf-import-count-badge" class="badge" style="font-size: 0.65rem;">0 disponibles</span>
							</div>
							<div style="display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center;">
								<select id="pdf-source-select" class="form-input" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.5rem; background: var(--bg-tertiary);">
									<option value="">Seleccionar PDF / Ontología...</option>
								</select>
								<button type="button" id="import-pdf-imgs-btn" class="btn-small btn-primary-action" style="font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.3rem 0.6rem; white-space: nowrap;">
									📥 Cargar al Visor
								</button>
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Image Gallery -->
						<div class="image-gallery" id="image-gallery"></div>

						<!-- Segmentation controls -->
						<div class="parameters-area">
							<!-- Structure Scale Selector (Microestructura vs Macroestructura) -->
							<div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 0.5rem; background: rgba(6,182,212,0.06); padding: 0.55rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.25);">
								<label style="font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.78rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
									<span style="color: var(--accent-cyan); display: flex; align-items: center; gap: 0.3rem;">
										📐 Escala Estructural:
									</span>
									<span id="active-scale-badge" class="badge" style="font-size: 0.65rem; background: #0284c7; color: #fff;">🔬 Microestructura</span>
								</label>
								<div class="scale-selector-bar" style="display: flex; gap: 0.35rem;">
									<button type="button" class="scale-btn active" id="btn-scale-micro" data-scale="micro" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.74rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.3rem; border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 700; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; transition: all 0.15s; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.25rem;">
										🔬 Micro (Células/Núcleos)
									</button>
									<button type="button" class="scale-btn" id="btn-scale-macro" data-scale="macro" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.74rem; padding: 0.4rem 0.3rem; border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; background: transparent; color: var(--text-muted); transition: all 0.15s; display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.25rem;">
										🏛️ Macro (Capas/Glándulas)
									</button>
								</div>
								<div id="scale-info-text" style="font-size: 0.67rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-top: 0.35rem; line-height: 1.3;">
									Segmentación de células individuales y núcleos (Cellpose-SAM / Meta SAM 3.1).
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Model Engine Selector (SAM 3 vs Cellpose) -->
							<div class="form-group" style="margin-bottom: 0.2rem;">
								<label style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.78rem; display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
									<span>🧠 Motor de Segmentación:</span>
									<span id="active-engine-badge" class="badge" style="font-size: 0.6rem; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;">SAM 3.1</span>
								</label>
								<div class="engine-selector-bar" style="display: flex; gap: 0.35rem; background: var(--bg-tertiary); padding: 0.25rem; border-radius: 8px; border: 1px solid var(--border-color);">
									<button type="button" class="engine-btn active" id="btn-engine-sam3" data-engine="sam3" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; background: var(--primary); color: #fff; transition: all 0.15s;">
										⚡ SAM 3.1
									</button>
									<button type="button" class="engine-btn" id="btn-engine-cellpose" data-engine="cellpose" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; border: none; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer; font-weight: 600; background: transparent; color: var(--text-muted); transition: all 0.15s;">
										🔬 Cellpose-SAM
									</button>
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Cellpose Specific Parameters Box -->
							<div id="cellpose-params-box" style="display: none; background: rgba(6,182,212,0.06); border: 1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.3); border-radius: 8px; padding: 0.55rem; margin-top: 0.35rem;">
								<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
									<span style="font-size: 0.72rem; font-weight: 600; color: var(--accent-cyan);">🔬 Modelo Histológico:</span>
									<span style="font-size: 0.62rem; color: #10b981; font-weight: 600;">GPU Activa</span>
								</div>
								<select id="cellpose-submodel-select" class="form-input" style="font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.45rem; background: var(--bg-main); width: 100%; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
									<option value="cpsam">Cellpose-SAM (ViT SAM - Recomendado)</option>
									<option value="cpsam_v2">Cellpose-SAM v2 (High-Res ViT SAM)</option>
									<option value="nuclei">Cellpose Nuclei (Núcleos Celulares Densos)</option>
									<option value="cyto3">Cellpose Cyto3 (Citoplasma y Células Completas)</option>
									<option value="tissuenet">Cellpose TissueNet (Cortes Histológicos)</option>
								</select>
								<div style="display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; align-items: center;">
									<label for="cellpose-diameter-input" style="font-size: 0.68rem; color: var(--text-muted); white-space: nowrap;">Diámetro célula (px):</label>
									<input type="number" id="cellpose-diameter-input" placeholder="Auto" min="1" max="500" class="form-input-sm" style="width: 70px; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.2rem 0.35rem; background: var(--bg-main);" />
									<span style="font-size: 0.65rem; color: var(--text-muted);">(Vacío = Auto)</span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<!-- Prompt Input -->
							<div class="form-group" style="margin-top: 0.5rem;">
								<label for="custom-prompt-input" style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center; margin-bottom: 0.35rem;">
									<span id="prompt-input-label" style="font-weight: 600; font-size: 0.78rem;">🎯 Elementos a segmentar:</span>
									<span id="prompt-input-badge" class="badge" style="font-size: 0.6rem; padding: 0.1rem 0.35rem;">Open-Vocabulary</span>
								</label>
								<div class="input-with-btn" style="flex-direction: column; gap: 0.4rem;">
									<input type="text" id="custom-prompt-input" placeholder="Ej: cell nucleus, lumen o person, glasses, tie" class="form-input" style="width: 100%; font-size: 0.8rem;" />
									<div style="display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; width: 100%;">
										<button type="button" id="re-segment-btn" class="btn-action btn-primary-action" style="flex: 2; margin: 0; padding: 0.45rem 0.6rem; font-size: 0.78rem;">
											⚡ Segmentar
										</button>
										<button type="button" id="auto-segment-btn" class="btn-small btn-outline" style="flex: 1; padding: 0.45rem 0.5rem; font-size: 0.72rem;" title="Descubrimiento automático con ontología">
											🪄 Auto
										</button>
									</div>
									<div style="display: flex; gap: 0.35rem; width: 100%; margin-top: 0.25rem;">
										<button type="button" id="quick-segment-micro-btn" class="btn-small" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.35rem; background: rgba(6,182,212,0.15); color: #38bdf8; border: 1px solid rgba(6,182,212,0.3); font-weight: 700; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;">
											🔬 Segmentar Micro
										</button>
										<button type="button" id="quick-segment-macro-btn" class="btn-small" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.35rem; background: rgba(59,130,246,0.15); color: #60a5fa; border: 1px solid rgba(59,130,246,0.3); font-weight: 700; border-radius: 6px; cursor: pointer;">
											🏛️ Segmentar Macro
										</button>
									</div>
									<button type="button" id="sidebar-pipeline-integral-btn" class="btn-action" style="width: 100%; margin-top: 0.35rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #10b981 0%, #06b6d4 50%, #3b82f6 100%); color: white; font-weight: 700; font-size: 0.76rem; padding: 0.5rem; border-radius: 6px; border: none; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(6,182,212,0.3); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.4rem; cursor: pointer;" title="Flujo completo: 1) Gemini analiza Macro y Micro ontología espacial, 2) Cellpose segmenta células, 3) Virchow 2 + Gemini clasifican con precisión">
										✨ Pipeline Macro/Micro + Cellpose + Virchow
									</button>
								</div>
								<!-- Prompt suggestion tags -->
								<div class="prompt-tags" id="prompt-tags-container" style="display: flex; flex-wrap: wrap; gap: 0.3rem; margin-top: 0.45rem;">
									<span class="prompt-chip" data-concept="cell nucleus">🔬 Células</span>
									<span class="prompt-chip" data-concept="tubular lumen cavity">⭕ Lumen</span>
									<span class="prompt-chip" data-concept="basement membrane boundary or wall">🧱 Membrana / Pared</span>
									<span class="prompt-chip" data-concept="blood vessel structure">🩸 Vasos</span>
									<span class="prompt-chip" data-concept="epithelial tissue layer">🧬 Epitelio</span>
									<span class="prompt-chip" data-concept="stroma interstitial tissue">🕸️ Estroma</span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<div class="form-group">
								<div class="slider-header">
									<label for="threshold-slider">Umbral de confianza</label>
									<span id="threshold-val" class="slider-val">0.25</span>
								</div>
								<input type="range" id="threshold-slider" min="0.01" max="0.95" step="0.01" value="0.25" class="form-range" />
							</div>
						</div>

						<!-- Status -->
						<div class="status-area" id="status-area">
							<div class="status-idle" id="status-idle">
								<span class="status-dot idle"></span>
								<span>Esperando imágenes...</span>
							</div>
							<div class="status-running" id="status-running" style="display:none;">
								<span class="spinner-small"></span>
								<span id="status-text">Segmentando...</span>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- ==================== CLASSES TAB ==================== -->
					<div class="tab-content" id="classes-tab">
						<div class="classes-header" style="flex-direction: column; gap: 0.5rem; align-items: stretch; margin-bottom: 0.5rem;">
							<div style="display: flex; justify-content: space-between; align-items: center;">
								<h3 class="section-title-sm">Clases y Categorías</h3>
								<button type="button" id="merge-classes-btn" class="btn-small btn-outline" disabled>Fusionar</button>
							</div>
							<div style="display: flex; gap: 0.35rem;">
								<input type="text" id="new-class-input" placeholder="Añadir clase (ej: Espermatocito)" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; background: var(--bg-tertiary); border: 1px solid var(--border-color); border-radius: 6px; color: var(--text-main);" />
								<button type="button" id="add-class-btn" class="btn-small btn-green" style="white-space: nowrap;">➕ Clase</button>
							</div>
							<div style="display: flex; gap: 0.35rem; margin-top: 0.2rem;">
								<button type="button" id="load-ontology-cells-btn" class="btn-small btn-outline" style="flex: 1; font-size: 0.72rem; padding: 0.35rem 0.5rem; color: var(--accent-cyan); border-color: rgba(6,182,212,0.4);" title="Cargar todas las subpoblaciones celulares de la ontología">
									🧬 Cargar Células de la Ontología (PDF)
								</button>
							</div>
							<button type="button" id="classify-gemini-btn" class="btn-action" style="margin-top: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 0.48rem 0.75rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7 0%, #3b82f6 50%, #8b5cf6 100%); color: #ffffff; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 2px 10px rgba(59,130,246,0.35); display: flex; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.4rem;" title="Etiquetar todas las células segmentadas usando Gemini Vision en una sola llamada">
								✨ Etiquetar con Gemini Vision (Batch)
							</button>
							<button type="button" id="classify-conch-btn" class="btn-action" style="margin-top: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #059669, #0d9488); color: #ffffff; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 700; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(13,148,136,0.35);" title="Ensamble cuádruple de patología: Virchow 2 (1280d) + UNI (1024d) + CONCH (512d) + Lunit DINO (384d)">
								🧬 Auto-Clasificar (Virchow + UNI + CONCH + DINO)
							</button>
							<button type="button" id="langgraph-classify-btn" class="btn-action" style="margin-top: 0.35rem; font-size: 0.78rem; padding: 0.45rem 0.75rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #2563eb, #7c3aed); color: #ffffff; border: none; border-radius: 6px; font-weight: 600; cursor: pointer; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(124,58,237,0.25);" title="Pipeline Multi-Agente con LangGraph, Detección de Etiquetas/Leyendas, CONCH, Virchow2 y DINO">
								🤖 LangGraph Multi-Agente (Leyendas + CONCH/Virchow/DINO)
							</button>
						</div>
						<div id="classes-list" class="classes-list">
							<p class="empty-hint">Segmenta una imagen para ver las clases detectadas.</p>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- ==================== EXPORT TAB ==================== -->
					<div class="tab-content" id="export-tab">
						<div class="export-section">
							<h3 class="section-title-sm">Exportar Dataset</h3>

							<div class="export-stats" id="export-stats">
								<div class="stat-item">
									<span class="stat-val" id="stat-total-imgs">0</span>
									<span class="stat-lbl">Imágenes</span>
								</div>
								<div class="stat-item">
									<span class="stat-val" id="stat-annotated-imgs">0</span>
									<span class="stat-lbl">Anotadas</span>
								</div>
								<div class="stat-item">
									<span class="stat-val" id="stat-total-dets">0</span>
									<span class="stat-lbl">Instancias</span>
								</div>
								<div class="stat-item">
									<span class="stat-val" id="stat-total-classes">0</span>
									<span class="stat-lbl">Clases</span>
								</div>
							</div>

							<button type="button" id="export-coco-btn" class="btn-action btn-outline">
								💾 Descargar COCO JSON
							</button>

							<div class="divider"></div>

							<h3 class="section-title-sm">🎓 Reporte del Estudiante & Exportación</h3>
							<p style="font-size: 0.72rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.6rem;">
								Descarga los resultados de tu sesión de aprendizaje y autoevaluación histológica con las validaciones de Gemini 3.5.
							</p>
							<div style="display: flex; gap: 0.4rem; flex-direction: column;">
								<button type="button" id="export-student-report-btn" class="btn-action" style="background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #38bdf8); color: #fff; font-weight: 700; border: none; border-radius: 6px; padding: 0.5rem; cursor: pointer;">
									🎓 Descargar Reporte de Aprendizaje (.JSON)
								</button>
								<button type="button" id="export-coco-btn" class="btn-action btn-outline">
									💾 Descargar Anotaciones COCO (.JSON)
								</button>
							</div>
						</div>
					</div>

					<!-- ==================== PDF ONTOLOGY TAB ==================== -->
					<div class="tab-content" id="pdf-tab">
						<div class="pdf-section">
							<h3 class="section-title-sm">Subir PDF Académico</h3>
							<p style="font-size: 0.75rem; color: var(--text-muted); margin-bottom: 0.75rem;">Subí un PDF de histología o microscopía. Se extrae el texto, se generan las ontologías con IA y podés gestionar y segmentar todas sus imágenes.</p>

							<div class="upload-zone" id="pdf-drop-zone" style="min-height: 100px; padding: 1.25rem; border: 2px dashed rgba(6,182,212,0.4); background: rgba(6,182,212,0.03); display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; justify-content: center; gap: 0.5rem; cursor: pointer; transition: all 0.2s ease;">
								<div class="upload-content" id="pdf-upload-content" style="display: flex; flex-direction: column; align-items: center; width: 100%; pointer-events: none;">
									<svg xmlns="http://www.w3.org/2000/svg" class="upload-icon" style="width: 32px; height: 32px; color: var(--accent-cyan);" fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor">
										<path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="1.5" d="M9 12h6m-6 4h6m2 5H7a2 2 0 01-2-2V5a2 2 0 012-2h5.586a1 1 0 01.707.293l5.414 5.414a1 1 0 01.293.707V19a2 2 0 01-2 2z" />
