								⚖️ Evaluar con Gemini (LLM)
							</button>
							<button type="button" id="viewer-classify-gemini-btn" class="btn-small btn-primary-action" style="font-size: 0.75rem; padding: 0.25rem 0.65rem; background: linear-gradient(135deg, #0284c7, #8b5cf6); color: #ffffff; border: none; font-weight: 700; box-shadow: 0 2px 8px rgba(139,92,246,0.35);" title="Etiquetar las células segmentadas usando Gemini Vision en batch (1 sola llamada)">
